[Thinking]
**Creating HTML for a CSGO site**

The user wants "complete HTML for a CSGO website," which seems a bit unclear regarding complexity. I'm guessing they'll need a simple single-page site. I'll provide a full HTML boilerplate, including CSS and maybe some JS, but I don't want to be overly verbose. I should include sections like hero, about, maps, weapons, news, gallery, and contact, using embedded CSS without any external libraries. Let's get this organized!
[/Thinking]

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>CS:GO Fan Hub</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <!-- Basic SEO -->
    <meta name="description" content="CS:GO Fan Hub – maps, weapons, news, tips, and more for Counter‑Strike: Global Offensive players.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="csgo, counter strike, counter-strike, global offensive, fps, esports">
    <meta name="author" content="Your Name">

    <style>
        /* ====== RESET / BASE ====== */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background-color: #050608;
            color: #f4f4f4;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        a {
            color: #ffcc00;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            display: block;
        }

        /* ====== LAYOUT ====== */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
            z-index: 999;
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* ====== NAVBAR ====== */
        .nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0.75rem 0;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #ffcc00;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #f4f4f4;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.25rem;
        }

        nav li a {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Mobile nav */
        .nav-toggle {
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .nav-toggle span {
            display: block;
            width: 22px;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: #fff;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav ul {
                position: absolute;
                top: 56px;
                right: 0;
                background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.98);
                flex-direction: column;
                width: 200px;
                padding: 1rem;
                display: none;
            }

            nav ul.open {
                display: flex;
            }

            .nav-toggle {
                display: flex;
            }
        }

        /* ====== HERO SECTION ====== */
        .hero {
            background: url("https://images.pexels.com/photos/907230/pexels-photo-907230.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600")
                        center/cover no-repeat;
            height: 100vh;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.9), rgba(0,0,0,0.4));
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            padding-top: 80px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #ffcc00;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 480px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #ddd;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 3px;
            border: 1px solid #ffcc00;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #ffcc00;
            color: #111;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #ffd633;
            border-color: #ffd633;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;
            color: #ffcc00;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.1);
        }

        /* ====== SECTIONS GENERAL ====== */
        section {
            padding: 4rem 0;
        }

        section:nth-of-type(even) {
            background-color: #0b0c10;
        }

        section:nth-of-type(odd) {
            background-color: #050608;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffcc00;
            padding-left: 0.75rem;
        }

        .section-subtitle {
            color: #aaa;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        /* ====== ABOUT ====== */
        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .about-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .about-list li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            padding-left: 1rem;
            position: relative;
            color: #ddd;
        }

        .about-list li::before {
            content: "•";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: #ffcc00;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .about-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        /* ====== MAPS ====== */
        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #111319;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #1b1d25;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .card img {
            height: 150px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .card-body {
            padding: 1rem;
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .card-text {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #bbb;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 2px;
            background: #222633;
            color: #ffcc00;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* ====== WEAPONS ====== */
        .table-wrapper {
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        th, td {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #111319;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #222633;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
            background-color: #0d1018;
        }

        tbody tr:nth-child(odd) {
            background-color: #070910;
        }

        tbody tr:hover {
            background-color: #181b24;
        }

        /* ====== NEWS / BLOG ====== */
        .news-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1.2fr;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .news-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .news-item {
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1f2a;
        }

        .news-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .news-meta {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #999;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }

        .news-item h3 {
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }

        .news-item p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #ccc;
        }

        .patchnote {
            background-color: #0e111a;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 1rem;
            border: 1px solid #1d2231;
        }

        .patchnote h3 {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .patchnote ul {
            margin-left: 1.25rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .patchnote li {
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* ====== GALLERY ====== */
        .gallery-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0,1fr));
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .gallery-grid img {
            height: 140px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 3px;
            border: 1px solid #1a1d26;
            transition: transform 0.15s ease-in-out, box-shadow 0.15s ease-in-out;
        }

        .gallery-grid img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .gallery-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr));
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .gallery-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
            }
        }

        /* ====== CONTACT / JOIN ====== */
        .contact-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .contact-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        form {
            display: grid;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        label {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #ccc;
        }

        input, textarea, select {
            padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem;
            background-color: #050608;
            border: 1px solid #1a1d26;
            border-radius: 3px;
            color: #f4f4f4;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        input:focus, textarea:focus, select:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #ffcc00;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.3);
        }

        textarea {
            min-height: 120px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .form-row-2 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .form-row-2 {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .contact-info {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #ccc;
        }

        .contact-info p {
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }

        .contact-info strong {
            color: #ffcc00;
        }

        /* ====== FOOTER ====== */
        footer {
            background-color: #000;
            border-top: 1px solid #222;
            padding: 1.5rem 0;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #999;
        }

        .footer-flex {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .footer-flex {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: #999;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: #ffcc00;
        }
    </style>
</head>
